      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Client can set compile time option to track the last element in the list. \nThis enables O(1) emplace_back(...) and O(1) back(). \nIf the option is set -> sizeof(BaseNode) increases by 8. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Client can set compile time option to track the last element in the list. \nThis enables O(1) emplace_back(...) and O(1) back(). \nIf the option is set -> sizeof(BaseNode) increases by 8. ",
